    "hash": "sha256:90bdce49d65c08ad815c5f9241729169006eb300fb8c2064ca1dcf41933a19d5",
    "markdown": "## Plan overview\n\n| | |\n| --- | --- |\n| Target | Selected project |\n| Studio | Required |\n| Stages | 2 |\n| Work / checks | 6 / 2 |\n\n## Change scope\n\nBounded feature addition to the existing game. Blast-radius risk: unknown. Preserve unrelated systems.\n\n## Goal\n\nImplement a simple flight combat prototype with WASD/Space/Shift keyboard controls, gamepad support, projectile shooting, and PvP damage. All new assets and scripts will be organized under 'FlightFlowTest' folders within their respective services.\n\n## Risks and assumptions\n\n### Risks\n\n- Network latency may affect the smoothness of flight controls and projectile accuracy, requiring client-side prediction or server-side reconciliation for a polished experience (beyond prototype scope).\n- Client-authoritative flight movement, while simpler for a prototype, could be exploitable without server-side validation (not included in this basic prototype).\n- Collision detection for fast-moving projectiles might be inconsistent without advanced techniques (e.g., raycasting, swept AABB) (not included in this basic prototype).\n\n### Assumptions\n\n- The game uses standard Roblox R15/R6 character models.\n- Players will control their own character directly for flight, not a separate vehicle model.\n- Default Roblox character movement will be disabled and replaced by custom flight mechanics.\n- PvP damage will utilize the standard Humanoid.Health property.\n\n## User experience\n\n- Players will control their character's flight using WASD for movement, Space for ascent, and Shift for descent.\n- Gamepad users will have equivalent flight and shooting controls.\n- Players can shoot projectiles at other players.\n- Players will take damage from enemy projectiles.\n\n## Systems affected\n\n- Player Character Movement\n- Input Handling\n- Projectile System\n- Damage System\n- Replication\n\n## Objects and scripts to create\n\n- Folder: ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest\n- Folder: StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/FlightFlowTest\n- Folder: ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest\n- Part: ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest/ProjectileModel\n- RemoteEvent: ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest/ShootEvent\n- LocalScript: StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/FlightFlowTest/FlightController\n- Script: ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest/PlayerSetup\n- Script: ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest/ProjectileManager\n\n## Existing objects to modify\n\n- Player Character (for flight mechanics and damage)\n\n## Assets required\n\n- Projectile Model\n\n## Workflow\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  REQUEST([\"Request\"])\n  subgraph STAGE_1[\"Setup Core Assets\"]\n    direction TB\n  STEP_1[\"Create Project Folders · studio · create\"]\n  STEP_2[\"Create Projectile Model · studio · create\"]\n  STEP_3[\"Create Shoot RemoteEvent · studio · create\"]\n  end\n  subgraph STAGE_2[\"Implement Core Logic\"]\n    direction TB\n  STEP_4[\"Create Player Setup Script · server · create\"]\n  STEP_5[\"Create Flight Controller Script · client · create\"]\n  STEP_6[\"Create Projectile Manager Script · server · create\"]\n  end\n  subgraph VERIFICATION[\"Verification\"]\n    direction TB\n  VERIFY_1([\"Verify Flight Controls · studio · verify\"])\n  VERIFY_2([\"Verify Projectile Shooting and PvP Damage · studio · verify\"])\n  end\n  REQUEST --> STEP_1\n  TARGET_1_1[\"ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest\"]\n  STEP_1 -. create .-> TARGET_1_1\n  class TARGET_1_1 target\n  TARGET_1_2[\"StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/FlightFlowTest\"]\n  STEP_1 -. create .-> TARGET_1_2\n  class TARGET_1_2 target\n  STEP_1 --> STEP_2\n  TARGET_2_1[\"ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest/ProjectileModel\"]\n  STEP_2 -. create .-> TARGET_2_1\n  class TARGET_2_1 target\n  STEP_1 --> STEP_3\n  TARGET_3_1[\"ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest/ShootEvent\"]\n  STEP_3 -. create .-> TARGET_3_1\n  class TARGET_3_1 target\n  STEP_1 --> STEP_4\n  TARGET_4_1[\"ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest/PlayerSetup\"]\n  STEP_4 -. create .-> TARGET_4_1\n  class TARGET_4_1 target\n  STEP_1 --> STEP_5\n  STEP_3 --> STEP_5\n  TARGET_5_1[\"StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/FlightFlowTest/FlightController\"]\n  STEP_5 -. create .-> TARGET_5_1\n  class TARGET_5_1 target\n  STEP_1 --> STEP_6\n  STEP_2 --> STEP_6\n  STEP_3 --> STEP_6\n  TARGET_6_1[\"ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest/ProjectileManager\"]\n  STEP_6 -. create .-> TARGET_6_1\n  class TARGET_6_1 target\n  STEP_4 --> VERIFY_1\n  STEP_5 --> VERIFY_1\n  STEP_5 --> VERIFY_2\n  STEP_6 --> VERIFY_2\n  COMPLETE([\"Ready to execute\"])\n  VERIFY_1 --> COMPLETE\n  VERIFY_2 --> COMPLETE\n  ROLLBACK[\"Restore snapshot\"]\n  STEP_1 -. failure .-> ROLLBACK\n  STEP_2 -. failure .-> ROLLBACK\n  STEP_3 -. failure .-> ROLLBACK\n  STEP_4 -. failure .-> ROLLBACK\n  STEP_5 -. failure .-> ROLLBACK\n  STEP_6 -. failure .-> ROLLBACK\n  class ROLLBACK rollback\n  class STEP_1 work\n  class STEP_2 work\n  class STEP_3 work\n  class STEP_4 work\n  class STEP_5 work\n  class STEP_6 work\n  class VERIFY_1 verify\n  class VERIFY_2 verify\n  classDef work fill:#17151f,stroke:#776b99,color:#f4f1ff\n  classDef decision fill:#201b2e,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#f4f1ff\n  classDef verify fill:#13231d,stroke:#4fb286,color:#ecfff7\n  classDef target fill:#111827,stroke:#64748b,color:#e5e7eb,stroke-dasharray:4 3\n  classDef rollback fill:#2a1719,stroke:#d66a73,color:#fff1f2\n```\n\n## Implementation steps\n\n### Setup Core Assets\n\n1. **Create Project Folders** — Create the necessary 'FlightFlowTest' folders in ReplicatedStorage, StarterPlayerScripts, and ServerScriptService to organize all new assets and scripts.\n   <nexus-file path=\"ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest\" action=\"create\" kind=\"instance\">FlightFlowTest Folder (ReplicatedStorage)</nexus-file> <nexus-file path=\"StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/FlightFlowTest\" action=\"create\" kind=\"instance\">FlightFlowTest Folder (StarterPlayerScripts)</nexus-file> <nexus-file path=\"ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest\" action=\"create\" kind=\"instance\">FlightFlowTest Folder (ServerScriptService)</nexus-file>\n   _studio · create · snapshot protected_\n2. **Create Projectile Model** — Create a simple Part named 'ProjectileModel' inside 'ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest'. Configure its properties (e.g., CanCollide=false, Anchored=false, Size, Color) to represent a basic projectile.\n   <nexus-file path=\"ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest/ProjectileModel\" action=\"create\" kind=\"instance\">Projectile Model</nexus-file>\n   _studio · create · snapshot protected_\n3. **Create Shoot RemoteEvent** — Create a RemoteEvent named 'ShootEvent' inside 'ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest'. This will be used for client-to-server communication for shooting projectiles.\n   <nexus-file path=\"ReplicatedStorage/FlightFlowTest/ShootEvent\" action=\"create\" kind=\"instance\">ShootEvent RemoteEvent</nexus-file>\n   _studio · create · snapshot protected_\n\n### Implement Core Logic\n\n1. **Create Player Setup Script** — Create a Server Script named 'PlayerSetup' in 'ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest'. This script will handle initial player character setup, such as disabling default movement and enabling custom flight mechanics upon player spawn.\n   <nexus-file path=\"ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest/PlayerSetup\" action=\"create\" kind=\"studio_script\">PlayerSetup Script</nexus-file>\n   _server · create · snapshot protected_\n2. **Create Flight Controller Script** — Create a LocalScript named 'FlightController' in 'StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/FlightFlowTest'. This script will manage player input (WASD, Space, Shift, Gamepad) for flight movement and send shooting requests to the server.\n   <nexus-file path=\"StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/FlightFlowTest/FlightController\" action=\"create\" kind=\"studio_script\">FlightController Script</nexus-file>\n   _client · create · snapshot protected_\n3. **Create Projectile Manager Script** — Create a Server Script named 'ProjectileManager' in 'ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest'. This script will listen for 'ShootEvent', create and manage projectiles, handle their movement, detect collisions, and apply PvP damage.\n   <nexus-file path=\"ServerScriptService/FlightFlowTest/ProjectileManager\" action=\"create\" kind=\"studio_script\">ProjectileManager Script</nexus-file>\n   _server · create · snapshot protected_\n\n## Verification steps\n\n1. **Verify Flight Controls** — Player character responds correctly to flight input and cannot walk/jump normally.\n2. **Verify Projectile Shooting and PvP Damage** — Projectiles are fired, hit other players, and reduce their health. No self-damage.",
